+    A single-node server (``nnodes == 1``, no ``--dist-init-addr``) rendezvouses on loopback,
+    where all of its ranks run, and init_distributed_environment binds a loopback rendezvous's
+    store to loopback only. ``--host`` is the HTTP bind address: upstream v0.5.10 used it here,
