+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets in the server arguments
+# ServerArgs fields that hold secrets. They are never returned by an endpoint (/server_info,
+# /get_server_info, the scheduler's internal state), never logged (ServerArgs declares them with
+# repr=False) and never written to the multi-tokenizer shared-memory segment.
